# Canonical sshd_config for Linux-server (fixed — do not hand-edit per-run)
# User: Hamid | Port 22 | Key + password auth
Port 22
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0
PermitRootLogin no
PasswordAuthentication yes
PubkeyAuthentication yes
AuthorizedKeysFile .ssh/authorized_keys
ChallengeResponseAuthentication no
UsePAM yes
X11Forwarding yes
PrintMotd no
AcceptEnv LANG LC_*
Subsystem sftp /usr/lib/openssh/sftp-server
AllowUsers Hamid
